<li><a href="https://www.callofdutyzombies.com/easteregg/guides/black_ops_iv_zombies/454_main-easter-eggs/tag-der-toten-salvation-lies-above/power-the-device-r242/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Supplementary walkthrough (7) ↗</a></li></ul><p>Select any reference image to enlarge it. Screenshot and symbol sources are credited in the linked walkthroughs; this guide uses local copies for reliable access.</p></section></div></template>
